# ========================
# Local AI Agent Config (per-developer)
# ========================
# These hold personal agent settings and global skill symlinks.
# They are environment-specific and should not be committed.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# Global agent kit symlinks (point to ~/.ai-agents/*)
# Git already skips symlink targets, but entries document intent
# and protect against accidental real directories in the future.
.agents/
.codex/
.opencode/
.pi/
